{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17558","headline":"诸葛丞相庙 · 武少仪","name":"诸葛丞相庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"执简焚香入庙门，武侯神象俨如存。\n因机定蜀延衰汉，以计连吴振弱孙。\n欲尽智能倾僭盗，善持忠节转庸昏。\n宣王请战贻巾帼，始见才吞亦气吞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武少仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}